ame":"Breakdown.RemainderProductIntegrableStatement","namespace":"Breakdown","noncomputable":false,"noncomputable_section":true,"private":false,"proof_used_by":[],"proof_uses":[],"protected":false,"short":"RemainderProductIntegrableStatement","signature_end_line":19,"sorry":false,"statement_used_by":["Breakdown.remainderProductIntegrable","Breakdown.symbolExchange_of"],"statement_uses":["Breakdown.Space","Breakdown.secondOrderRemainder"],"used_by":["Breakdown.remainderProductIntegrable","Breakdown.symbolExchange_of"],"uses":["Breakdown.Space","Breakdown.secondOrderRemainder"],"written":"RemainderProductIntegrableStatement"}],"imports":["Breakdown.Frac.StOperator"],"module":"Breakdown.Frac.StSymbol","path":"Breakdown/Frac/StSymbol.lean","sha256":"9b93deed393b1c70a46e4b56ac1d3811552f9e0d3916408a743a24999c4b0c0b","source":"import Breakdown.Frac.StOperator\n\nopen scoped ContDiff\nopen MeasureTheory Real\n\nnoncomputable section\n\nnamespace Breakdown\n\ndef phaseRemainder (ξ z : Space) : ℂ :=\n  Complex.exp (((2 * π * inner ℝ z ξ : ℝ) : ℂ) * Complex.I) - 1\n    - ((2 * π * inner ℝ z ξ : ℝ) : ℂ) * Complex.I + ((2 * π ^ 2 * (inner ℝ z ξ) ^ 2 : ℝ) : ℂ)\n\ndef RemainderTransformStatement : Prop :=\n  ∀ φ : SchwartzMap Space Space, ∀ z ξ : Space,\n    FourierTransform.fourier (fun x => Freq.complexifyVec (secondOrderRemainder φ x z)) ξ =\n      phaseRemainder ξ z • FourierTransform.fourier (fun x => Freq.complexifyVec (φ x)) ξ\n\ndef RemainderProductIntegrableStatement : Prop :=\n  ∀ α : ℝ, 1 < α → α < 3 / 2 → ∀ φ : SchwartzMap Space Space,\n    Integrable (fun p : Space × Space => ‖p.2‖ ^ (-(3 + 2 * α)) * ‖secondOrderRemainder φ p.1 p.2‖)\n      (volume.prod volume)\n\nend Breakdown\n"}